	setcycle 57 condition ""
	setcycle 57 Condition_Num ""
	setcycle 57 comprehension_q ""
	setcycle 57 booklet ""
	setcycle 58 passage ""
	setcycle 58 line ""
	setcycle 58 line_text "She had a sudden and alarming attack of indisposition but was not <br/>considered in any precariousness. "
	setcycle 58 probe ""
	setcycle 58 condition ""
	setcycle 58 Condition_Num ""
	setcycle 58 comprehension_q ""
	setcycle 58 booklet ""
	setcycle 59 passage ""
	setcycle 59 line ""
	setcycle 59 line_text "One night, soon after, she awoke from a troubled slumber and, <br/>apparently with no idea that she was about to leave him, murmured in <br/>the tenderest fashion of her love for him, and in his arms her head <br/>drooped as though in a faint, but it was the end."
	setcycle 59 probe ""
	setcycle 59 condition ""
	setcycle 59 Condition_Num ""
	setcycle 59 comprehension_q ""
	setcycle 59 booklet ""
	setcycle 60 passage ""
	setcycle 60 line ""
	setcycle 60 line_text "A few had been astute enough to see a fine poet in Browning, and <br/>Elizabeth Barrett was one of them. "
	setcycle 60 probe ""
	setcycle 60 condition ""
