	setcycle 1 passage 2
	setcycle 1 line 1
	setcycle 1 line_text "Marketing is a business activity that directs the flow of goods and <br/>services from a producer to a consumer or user."
	setcycle 1 probe n
	setcycle 1 condition Easy
	setcycle 1 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 1 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 1 booklet 1
	setcycle 2 passage 2
	setcycle 2 line 2
	setcycle 2 line_text "It is the link that connects producers and consumers and brings <br/>production and consumption together."
	setcycle 2 probe n
	setcycle 2 condition Easy
	setcycle 2 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 2 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 2 booklet 1
	setcycle 3 passage 2
	setcycle 3 line 3
	setcycle 3 line_text "About one in every six employees is involved directly in wholesaling <br/>or retailing activities."
	setcycle 3 probe n
	setcycle 3 condition Easy
	setcycle 3 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 3 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 3 booklet 1
	setcycle 4 passage 2
	setcycle 4 line 4
