	setcycle 4 probe n
	setcycle 4 condition Easy
	setcycle 4 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 4 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 4 booklet 1
	setcycle 5 passage 2
	setcycle 5 line 5
	setcycle 5 line_text "Marketing provides many different kinds of jobs."
	setcycle 5 probe n
	setcycle 5 condition Easy
	setcycle 5 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 5 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 5 booklet 1
	setcycle 6 passage 2
	setcycle 6 line 6
	setcycle 6 line_text "These jobs require a wide range of skills and abilities."
	setcycle 6 probe n
	setcycle 6 condition Easy
	setcycle 6 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 6 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 6 booklet 1
	setcycle 7 passage 2
	setcycle 7 line 7
	setcycle 7 line_text "We usually think that the primary job in marketing is selling, but <br/>there are jobs in management, advertising, market and product <br/>research, and buying."
	setcycle 7 probe n
	setcycle 7 condition Easy
	setcycle 7 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 7 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 7 booklet 1
	setcycle 8 passage 2
	setcycle 8 line 8
	setcycle 8 line_text "The economic well-being of our country is determined largely by <br/>productivity, consumption, and employment."
	setcycle 8 probe y
	setcycle 8 condition Easy
	setcycle 8 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 8 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 8 booklet 1
	setcycle 9 passage 2
	setcycle 9 line 9
	setcycle 9 line_text "The efficiency of marketing affects all three."
	setcycle 9 probe n
	setcycle 9 condition Easy
	setcycle 9 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 9 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 9 booklet 1
	setcycle 10 passage 2
	setcycle 10 line 10
	setcycle 10 line_text "People consume many goods if marketing creates a demand."
	setcycle 10 probe n
	setcycle 10 condition Easy
	setcycle 10 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 10 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 10 booklet 1
	setcycle 11 passage 2
	setcycle 11 line 11
	setcycle 11 line_text "High consumption requires high productivity to meet the wants of <br/>people, and high productivity and high-level activity in marketing <br/>combined result in high employment."
	setcycle 11 probe y
	setcycle 11 condition Easy
	setcycle 11 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 11 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 11 booklet 1
	setcycle 12 passage 2
	setcycle 12 line 12
	setcycle 12 line_text "Marketing is indirectly a key to a high economic level of living <br>for the people."
	setcycle 12 probe n
	setcycle 12 condition Easy
	setcycle 12 Condition_Num 2
	setcycle 12 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 12 booklet 1
	run Passage_sequence

define loop Passage_2_Booklet_2
	set source_file ""
	set source table
	set repeat 1
	set order sequential
	set description "Repeatedly runs another item"
	set cycles 13
	set continuous no
	set break_if_on_first yes
	set break_if never
	setcycle 0 passage 2
	setcycle 0 line 0
	setcycle 0 line_text "Passage 2"
	setcycle 0 probe n
	setcycle 0 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 0 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 0 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 0 booklet 2
	setcycle 1 passage 2
	setcycle 1 line 1
	setcycle 1 line_text "The performance of those business activities that direct the flow <br/>of goods and services from producer to consumer or user is called <br/>marketing. "
	setcycle 1 probe n
	setcycle 1 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 1 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 1 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 1 booklet 2
	setcycle 2 passage 2
	setcycle 2 line 2
	setcycle 2 line_text "Marketing is the connecting link between the producer and the <br/>consumer or user. "
	setcycle 2 probe n
	setcycle 2 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 2 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 2 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 2 booklet 2
	setcycle 3 passage 2
	setcycle 3 line 3
	setcycle 3 line_text "Production and consumption are brought together by the marketing <br/>system."
	setcycle 3 probe n
	setcycle 3 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 3 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 3 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 3 booklet 2
	setcycle 4 passage 2
	setcycle 4 line 4
	setcycle 4 line_text "Wholesaling or retailing activities are directly engaged in by <br/>approximately one in every six gainfully employed persons. "
	setcycle 4 probe n
	setcycle 4 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 4 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 4 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 4 booklet 2
	setcycle 5 passage 2
	setcycle 5 line 5
	setcycle 5 line_text "This ratio does not take into account other persons who are serving <br/>marketing through transportation, communication, and office <br/>vocations."
	setcycle 5 probe n
	setcycle 5 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 5 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 5 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 5 booklet 2
	setcycle 6 passage 2
	setcycle 6 line 6
	setcycle 6 line_text "Opportunities for many kinds of positions requiring a wide range of <br/>skills and abilities is provided by marketing. "
	setcycle 6 probe n
	setcycle 6 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 6 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 6 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 6 booklet 2
	setcycle 7 passage 2
	setcycle 7 line 7
	setcycle 7 line_text "Although one naturally thinks of merchandising as being the primary <br/>occupation in marketing, there are opportunities in management, <br/>advertising, market and product research, and purchasing."
	setcycle 7 probe n
	setcycle 7 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 7 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 7 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 7 booklet 2
	setcycle 8 passage 2
	setcycle 8 line 8
	setcycle 8 line_text "The economic well-being of one's country is determined largely by <br/>productivity, consumption, and employment. "
	setcycle 8 probe y
	setcycle 8 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 8 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 8 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 8 booklet 2
	setcycle 9 passage 2
	setcycle 9 line 9
	setcycle 9 line_text "All three are affected by the efficiency of the marketing process. "
	setcycle 9 probe n
	setcycle 9 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 9 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 9 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 9 booklet 2
	setcycle 10 passage 2
	setcycle 10 line 10
	setcycle 10 line_text "If marketing stimulates appetite, people will consume goods at a <br/>high rate. "
	setcycle 10 probe n
	setcycle 10 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 10 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 10 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 10 booklet 2
	setcycle 11 passage 2
	setcycle 11 line 11
	setcycle 11 line_text "High consumption requires high productivity to meet the <br/>requirements of people, and high productivity and high-level <br/>activity in marketing combined result in high employment. "
	setcycle 11 probe y
	setcycle 11 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 11 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 11 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 11 booklet 2
	setcycle 12 passage 2
	setcycle 12 line 12
	setcycle 12 line_text "Indirectly, marketing is a key to a high level of economic living <br/>for the people."
	setcycle 12 probe n
	setcycle 12 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 12 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 12 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 12 booklet 2
	run Passage_sequence

define loop Passage_2_Comprehension
