	setcycle 0 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 0 booklet 2
	setcycle 1 passage 4
	setcycle 1 line 1
	setcycle 1 line_text "Even most skeptics, because they seem to share the hope that there <br/>is life on Mars, endeavor slavishly not to discount the possibility."
	setcycle 1 probe n
	setcycle 1 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 1 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 1 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 1 booklet 2
	setcycle 2 passage 4
	setcycle 2 line 2
	setcycle 2 line_text "But it was a comedown in the mid-1960's when scientists involved in <br/>the Mars exploration studied photographs taken by some of the early <br/>Mariner space flights."
	setcycle 2 probe n
	setcycle 2 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 2 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 2 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 2 booklet 2
	setcycle 3 passage 4
	setcycle 3 line 3
	setcycle 3 line_text "No canals."
	setcycle 3 probe n
	setcycle 3 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 3 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 3 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 3 booklet 2
	setcycle 4 passage 4
	setcycle 4 line 4
	setcycle 4 line_text "No seas."
	setcycle 4 probe n
	setcycle 4 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 4 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 4 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 4 booklet 2
	setcycle 5 passage 4
	setcycle 5 line 5
	setcycle 5 line_text "No busy Martian engineers."
	setcycle 5 probe n
	setcycle 5 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 5 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 5 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 5 booklet 2
	setcycle 6 passage 4
	setcycle 6 line 6
	setcycle 6 line_text "No menacing warmongering Martians as colossal as skyscrapers."
	setcycle 6 probe n
	setcycle 6 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 6 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 6 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 6 booklet 2
	setcycle 7 passage 4
	setcycle 7 line 7
	setcycle 7 line_text "Just mountains, craters, frigid winds, and dust storms."
	setcycle 7 probe n
	setcycle 7 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 7 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 7 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 7 booklet 2
	setcycle 8 passage 4
	setcycle 8 line 8
	setcycle 8 line_text "It was almost as if scouts for Columbus had returned to Isabella's <br/>court with the news that the world had turned out to be flat after <br/>all."
	setcycle 8 probe y
	setcycle 8 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 8 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 8 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 8 booklet 2
	setcycle 9 passage 4
	setcycle 9 line 9
	setcycle 9 line_text "Hopeful astronomers reminded us that the Mariner IV had photographed <br/>a mere one percent of the Martian surface from 2,000 miles away."
	setcycle 9 probe y
	setcycle 9 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 9 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 9 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 9 booklet 2
	setcycle 10 passage 4
	setcycle 10 line 10
	setcycle 10 line_text "And they pointed out that the Earth-orbiting Tiros weather satellite <br/>shot over 20,000 pictures before uncovering any evidence of life on <br/>Earth."
	setcycle 10 probe y
	setcycle 10 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 10 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 10 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 10 booklet 2
	setcycle 11 passage 4
	setcycle 11 line 11
	setcycle 11 line_text "But still, public enthusiasm for Martian exploration wilted."
	setcycle 11 probe y
	setcycle 11 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 11 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 11 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 11 booklet 2
	setcycle 12 passage 4
	setcycle 12 line 12
	setcycle 12 line_text "By the time Viking I touched down on the Plain of Chryse in August, <br/>few seemed to care at all. "
	setcycle 12 probe n
	setcycle 12 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 12 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 12 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 12 booklet 2
	setcycle 13 passage 4
	setcycle 13 line 13
	setcycle 13 line_text "J. Richard Keefe, one of the Viking scientists, declared himself <br/>'disgusted' at what he called the 'blasé ...apathetic' public <br/>response and the skimpy television coverage of what was certainly <br/>one of the magnificent scientific and technical accomplishments in human <br/>history."
	setcycle 13 probe n
	setcycle 13 condition "Diff."
	setcycle 13 Condition_Num 1
	setcycle 13 comprehension_q n
	setcycle 13 booklet 2
	run Passage_sequence

define loop Passage_4_Comprehension
